	(text "Z80 CPU SUBSYSTEM (LAB 3)\n- U4: Z84C0004PEG (Z80 CMOS 4MHz CPU, 40-pin DIP, Socketed)\n- Pin 11: +5V (Decoupled with C10: 100nF Ceramic Bypass Capacitor mounted directly at Pin 11)\n- Pin 29: GND\n- Pin 6: CLK (driven by 4.0000 MHz TTL Oscillator)\n\nBUS PULL-UP RESISTOR NETWORK:\n- RN1: 10k x 5 Bussed SIP Resistor Network (SIP-6, 2.54mm pitch)\n  - Pin 1: Common +5V Rail\n  - Pin 2: nWAIT Pull-Up\n  - Pin 3: nBUSREQ Pull-Up\n  - Pin 4: nNMI Pull-Up\n  - Pin 5: nINT Pull-Up (guarantees nINT never floats when JP_INT is removed)\n  - Pin 6: Spare Active-Low Pull-Up\n\nTEST POINTS PROVIDED:\n- TP7: nMREQ, TP8: nIORQ, TP9: nRD, TP10: nWR, TP11: nM1, TP12: nWAIT, TP13: nINT"
		(at 38.1 152.4 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.3 1.3) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000065020090")
